       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is five times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. At that dose the patient would be at serious risk of serotonin syndrome, seizures, QT prolongation, and other toxicity.\n\nYou may have meant **100 mg** once daily. Typical dosing is:\n- **Starting dose:** 25\u201350 mg by mouth once daily. For depression, the usual start is 50 mg. For anxiety or panic disorder, it's often 25 mg.\n- **Titration:** Increase in 25\u201350 mg steps, no more often than weekly.\n- **Maximum:** 200 mg/day.\n\nPlease confirm the dose you want, and tell me the indication if you can. I'll enter the order once I have that. Review the dose with your supervising resident or attending and the pharmacist too."
